  "steps": [
    "In a large microwave-safe container with a lid, mix together the soy sauce, caster sugar and sriracha.",
    "Add the noodles, broccoli, red pepper and red onion. Pop the lid on and shake everything around to mix thoroughly.",
    "Microwave on high for 3 minutes, stirring once. Add the kale and beansprouts, then cook for a further 3 minutes.",
    "Sprinkle with sesame seeds to serve."
  ],
  "notes": "Buy a pre-prepared bag of stir-fry veg to skip the chopping entirely. You can also drizzle with a little sesame oil or extra sriracha before serving."
